"If the reduction machinery is valid, the additional sharing freedom could be relevant to parallel runtimes and machine architectures.","sourceUnitIds":["u000390"],"defines":[],"requires":["reduction machinery","parallel runtimes","machine architectures"],"mentions":["sharing freedom"],"fills":[],"need":"","gapType":null,"origin":"source"},{"kind":"marker","text":"The source marks the preceding proposition with a check symbol.","sourceUnitIds":["u000391"],"defines":[],"requires":[],"mentions":["check mark"],"fills":[],"need":"","gapType":null,"origin":"source"},{"kind":"heading","text":"One-sentence takeaway","sourceUnitIds":["u000392"],"defines":[],"requires":[],"mentions":["takeaway"],"fills":[],"need":"","gapType":null,"origin":"source"},{"kind":"summary","text":"Δ-Nets aims to make optimal parallel evaluation practical by representing each sharing context in a variable-arity replicator and combining local interactions with only the global discipline needed to prevent avoidable work.","sourceUnitIds":["u000393"],"defines":["variable-arity replicator"],"requires":["sharing context","local interactions","global discipline","optimal parallel evaluation"],"mentions":["preventable work"],"fills":[],"need":"","gapType":null,"origin":"source"}],"edges":[{"from":0,"to":14,"relation":"elaborates","reason":"The ΔA subsystem mapping contributes to the broader summary of Δ-Nets reduction machinery."},{"from":1,"to":14,"relation":"elaborates","reason":"The ΔI subsystem mapping contributes to the broader summary of Δ-Nets reduction machinery."},{"from":2,"to":14,"relation":"elaborates","reason":"The ΔK subsystem mapping contributes to the broader summary of Δ-Nets reduction machinery."},{"from":5,"to":6,"relation":"enables","reason":"The local interaction-system property is a lower layer of the whole-algorithm claim."},{"from":6,"to":7,"relation":"defines","reason":"The Church–Rosser explanation defines the confluence property named in the claim."},{"from":6,"to":8,"relation":